,"limitations","guidance","list","Setup","ordered",true,"items",[73,74,75],"setup","Start with the free binary and a fixed level to establish a control baseline.","For code edits, follow the repository build instructions with CMake and the required C++ dependencies.","Pin the game version, level, settings and input timing before comparing agents.","Try these tasks",false,[80,81,82],"testTasks","Modify jump acceleration or a collision edge case, then replay a fixed level.","Measure completion rate, deaths, missed jumps and time for a screen-based controller.","Change a level and verify checkpoints, enemies and completion conditions.","AI use and evaluation boundary","Code access supports instrumented experiments, but GPL code and CC BY-SA game data carry different obligations. Keep any redistributed screenshots, maps or data exports traceable to their source licenses.","aiUseNote","links","Supporting evidence",[90,91,92],"evidence",{"_54":97,"_25":98},{"_54":95,"_25":96},{"_54":93,"_25":94},"Independent downloads","https://www.supertux.org/download.html","Steam release","https://store.steampowered.com/app/1572920/SuperTux/","Official game source and licensing","https://github.com/SuperTux/supertux","Read the terms",[102],"licenseUrl",{"_54":99,"_25":98},"Terms category","Mixed code / asset licenses","terms","provenance","Asset license","Most game data uses CC BY-SA; individual files and third-party components have additional notices.","assetLicense","Code license","GNU GPL; inspect the pinned version and component notices before distributing a modified build.","codeLicense","Get started",[116],"access",{"_54":117,"_25":118,"_119":120},"Play official browser build","https://play.supertux.org/","note","Official browser play, a free Steam release and independent desktop downloads are available. Building modified core code requires the native toolchain.","Primary source",[124],"sourceUrl",{"_54":121,"_25":98},"Stack","C++ / CMake / 2D platformer","stack","Tracks",[131],"